-- Puzzles re-rated (puzzlegen's rating, 2026-10-26): what a person must understand first sets a floor
-- (several boards to play in one turn above all, timelines to read, an answer that travels or
-- checks from another board), and the calculation on top grows with the boards to play. A mate in
-- two with four timelines and three boards to play (d3eefa836ee99443) was 920 and is now 1380;
-- one-board puzzles keep their ratings. Each puzzle's rating moves by the same amount as its
-- initial rating, so what its plays taught is kept.
update public.puzzles p set rating = p.rating + (r.new_rating - p.initial_rating), initial_rating = r.new_rating
